==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 & 2'''===
[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can cheese this stage by destroying the enemy base before Project A comes out. Alternatively, you can also get the same result by spamming [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]].

==='''Chapter 3'''===
The cheese can still be done but has less margin for error. Kill the first [[Shibalien Elite]] using [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] with meatshields (1-2 [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat MK II]] or multiple [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cats]]), and kill the [[Mooth]] using [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer/Fishman Cat]], then use its money to summon [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to take out the second Shibalien Elite and the base, spamming any other high damage units such as [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev/Bullet Train Cat]]. Send some meatshields to avoid your attackers being killed by Mistress Celeboodle, and the base should fall during Axoloty's attack animation. It is advised to have all anti-starred alien treasures obtainable up to this point to make dealing with the Shibalien Elites far quicker

