==Trivia==
*The name of this stage may be a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Durarara!!|Durarara!!]]'', a light novel series and anime.
*All stages from Darararah through [[Ababwa (Cats of the Cosmos)|Ababwa]] have a robot (from the [[wikipedia:Mobile Suit Gundam|''Mobile Suit Gundam'']] series) on top of their base, with the lower half being the Pegasus White Base.
*Darararah on the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] map looks just like [[wikia:gundam:Granada|Granada]], a lunar city in ''Mobile Suit Gundam''. The two also have vaguely similar names in Japanese, with Darararah being ダラララ Dararara and Granada being グラナダ Guranada.

